    "body": "The other properties (word-spacing, line-height, text-transform, text-indent, text-shadow) are also different between native/primitive and base in Chromium.\r\n\r\nI would prefer these properties to be set only in the \"native/primitive\" sheet instead of being set to `initial` and then back to `inherit` (for base). I think it's not defined that the spec order of these separate sheets are of any importance, but if there are conflicting rules then the order is important.",
